## 📝 COMPLETE SECTION EXAMPLE

This example demonstrates all rules in action:

```liquid
{%- comment -%}
  sections/hero.liquid
  Hero section for homepage with background image and CTA
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="hero" id="hero-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="hero__container">
    <h1 class="hero__title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h1>
    <p class="hero__subtitle">{{ section.settings.subtitle }}</p>
    {%- if section.settings.cta_text != blank -%}
      <a href="{{ section.settings.cta_link }}" class="hero__button">
        {{ section.settings.cta_text }}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  #hero-{{ section.id }} {
    direction: rtl;
    text-align: right;
    background-image: url({{ section.settings.background_image | image_url: width: 1920 }});
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    min-height: 500px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  #hero-{{ section.id }} .hero__container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  
  #hero-{{ section.id }} .hero__title {
    font-family: 'Heebo', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-align: right;
  }
  
  #hero-{{ section.id }} .hero__subtitle {
    font-family: 'Assistant', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-align: right;
  }
  
  #hero-{{ section.id }} .hero__button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #CDB9A2;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Assistant', sans-serif;
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    #hero-{{ section.id }} .hero__title {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Hero",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "כותרת ראשית",
      "default": "ריהוט תינוקות איכותי"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "label": "תת כותרת",
      "default": "משלוח חינם לכל הארץ"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_text",
      "label": "טקסט כפתור"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_link",
      "label": "קישור כפתור"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "background_image",
      "label": "תמונת רקע"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Hero"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
```

**This example demonstrates:**
✅ RTL support (direction: rtl, text-align: right)
✅ Hebrew fonts (Heebo for headings, Assistant for body)
✅ Unique CSS scope (#hero-{{ section.id }})
✅ Mobile-responsive (@media queries)
✅ Image optimization (image_url filter with width)
✅ Schema with Hebrew labels
✅ Conditional rendering ({%- if -%})
✅ Proper Liquid comments

